<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms buy 20,000T of Argentine wheatbran.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms buy 20,000T of Argentine wheatbran.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Feed Association (KFA) in Pusan and a group of buyers, known as the Big Feed Mill, jointly bought 20,000 tonnes of Argentine wheatbran pellet at $114.5 a tonne C&amp;F, an official with the buyer group said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official said the purchase was made from Continental Grain through a private negotiation on Monday.</p>
<p>Arrival was set for June 20 to the two South Korean ports of Ulsan and Kunsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
